enough for a six thousand. Oh, then it's a deal. What are you talking about? What are you talking about? I'm talking about salt. Oh, we are talking about francs. You mean you want a thousand francs? Yes. Oh, you want a thousand francs a week in advance. And you sure have it. Oh, you took my advice and made yourself popular and I'm perfect.

